<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<body>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>
<div class="auth-box">
<h1>로그인</h1>
<% if (error) { %><p class="error"><%= error %></p><% } %>
<form action="/login" method="post">
  <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="아이디" required />
  <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="비밀번호" required />
  <% if (next) { %><input type="hidden" name="next" value="<%= next %>" /><% } %>
  <button type="submit">로그인</button>
</form>
<p>계정이 없으신가요? <a href="/signup/verify">회원가입</a></p>
</div>

<!-- 회원가입 완료 안내 팝업 -->
<div id="signupDoneModal" class="modal-overlay" style="display:<%= justSignedUp ? 'flex' : 'none' %>;">
  <div class="modal-box">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <span>알림</span>
      <button type="button" class="modal-close" data-modal="signupDoneModal">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <p>회원가입이 완료되었습니다. 로그인 해주세요.</p>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="modal-confirm" data-modal="signupDoneModal">확인</button>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-modal]').forEach(function (btn) {
    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      document.getElementById(btn.dataset.modal).style.display = 'none';
    });
  });
</script>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
